---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Digital Safety — Women Safety" description="Practical digital safety guidance for accounts, phones, privacy and evidence.">
  <section class="hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Women Safety</p><h1>Digital Safety</h1><p class="lead">Simple steps to protect your accounts, device, personal information and evidence.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container grid-2">
    <article class="card"><h2>Account security</h2><p class="muted">Use strong, unique passwords and multi-factor authentication. Review active sessions and recovery methods.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><h2>Phone security</h2><p class="muted">Use a screen lock, keep your device updated and be careful about accessibility or device-control permissions.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><h2>Privacy review</h2><p class="muted">Check app permissions, location sharing, Bluetooth visibility, cloud sharing and social-media audience settings.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><h2>Online abuse</h2><p class="muted">For threats, impersonation or intimate-image abuse, preserve relevant information when safe and consider the official Cyber Crime Reporting Portal.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><h2>Evidence</h2><p class="muted">When safe, keep original messages, URLs, usernames, dates, transaction references and screenshots. Never put yourself in danger to collect evidence.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><h2>Scams and pressure</h2><p class="muted">Never share OTPs, recovery codes, banking PINs or passwords with someone claiming to help. Be cautious with urgent payment requests and unknown links.</p></article>
  </div></section>
</Layout>